WEBVTT

00:12.920 --> 00:15.980
It's the fifth year since I met senpai.

00:20.670 --> 00:22.970
I've had this type of fantasy...

00:22.970 --> 00:27.120
such a sickening amount,
I don't even know how many times.

00:27.840 --> 00:30.560
Gugh... but today this...

00:32.390 --> 00:33.690
is reality!!

00:37.600 --> 00:40.140
Episode 2: We're dating now, right...?

00:45.070 --> 00:47.660
If this was my normal fantasy then...

00:48.900 --> 00:53.580
he would look like this,
smiling in the light of the sun

00:53.580 --> 00:56.170
of the morning we're meeting together, but...

00:56.210 --> 00:58.090
Good morning, Morinaga!

00:58.800 --> 01:01.590
Today that person is nowhere to be seen!!

01:03.630 --> 01:06.340
Ummm...?
What happened...?

01:06.720 --> 01:10.270
Huh...? Glasses... Where did I leave my glasses?

01:10.310 --> 01:11.300
Ah...

01:12.480 --> 01:13.440
Here...

01:14.310 --> 01:15.350
Oh, thank you.

01:18.610 --> 01:20.900
Morinaga...

01:22.110 --> 01:24.990
I-I-I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

01:25.570 --> 01:27.440
Yesterday you really...

01:27.780 --> 01:29.440
helped me out!

01:31.450 --> 01:35.790
Huh...? Is the drug... still in effect...?

01:34.850 --> 01:39.110
Attack power
98%
down

01:39.750 --> 01:43.630
...Thanks to you, I don't think it's because of the drug...

01:44.010 --> 01:45.880
Eh...? That's weird...

01:45.880 --> 01:48.550
I was sure I loosened you up really well...

01:48.600 --> 01:49.640
Loose-...!

01:49.680 --> 01:52.140
Y-you asshole! You're so shameless!!

01:53.060 --> 01:55.190
You have no remorse at all!

01:55.230 --> 01:58.730
Eh? Ah! No way...! I'm very remorseful!

01:58.770 --> 02:00.670
Then, Morinaga...

02:00.670 --> 02:02.960
I'd like to request something from you...

02:05.900 --> 02:08.820
Bring me a knife from the kitchen.

02:08.910 --> 02:12.700
Th-th-th-there's no way I can do that!!

02:13.450 --> 02:14.340
I see.

02:14.340 --> 02:15.280
Then...

02:15.500 --> 02:16.460
I'll take this...

02:16.920 --> 02:17.830
And do this!

02:18.750 --> 02:20.090
Okay, get over here!

02:21.250 --> 02:23.210
At least spare my life...

02:23.250 --> 02:24.630
I'm really sorry!!

02:25.670 --> 02:27.050
No arguments!

02:34.140 --> 02:37.520
Now... this time I won't miss.

02:38.900 --> 02:40.690
Woah... please wait!

02:40.690 --> 02:43.610
Am I the only one in the wrong here...?

02:43.650 --> 02:46.110
You were so insensitive, Senpai!

02:46.150 --> 02:47.280
What...?

02:47.950 --> 02:50.030
Even though you know about my feelings...

02:50.070 --> 02:52.950
You're always... too careless in front of me!

02:52.990 --> 02:56.790
To the point you even let me
see you like that yesterday...

02:56.790 --> 02:59.040
There's no way I could... hold back!

03:00.790 --> 03:02.540
...I trusted you!

03:06.130 --> 03:09.180
No... That wasn't trust...

03:09.220 --> 03:11.890
You were just looking down on me!

03:13.100 --> 03:14.220
Morinaga!

03:14.220 --> 03:16.220
What was that? You asshole...!?

03:22.940 --> 03:23.980
...Get out!

03:25.030 --> 03:26.860
This is my place...

03:26.860 --> 03:27.740
Shut up!

03:27.780 --> 03:29.610
Just don't let me see your face for a while!!

03:31.950 --> 03:32.920
...Okay.

03:33.820 --> 03:37.100
Please leave Before I come back, okay...?

03:45.920 --> 03:50.510
Ah... Damn it...
Everything is fucked up...

03:59.350 --> 04:02.690
Shit! ...That asshole!

04:03.900 --> 04:06.920
Damn it... This is fucked up...

04:06.920 --> 04:09.210
I'll never forgive him...

04:09.280 --> 04:10.530
Oww...

04:11.400 --> 04:13.410
It's throbbing inside...

04:19.120 --> 04:20.940
Shit! Shit!

04:20.940 --> 04:22.940
Seriously, that asshole!

04:23.880 --> 04:25.540
Fuck...

04:42.390 --> 04:47.070
I wonder if Senpai... got home safely?

04:47.940 --> 04:50.860
I really had no self control...

04:50.900 --> 04:53.660
and we both just fell asleep after that...

04:53.700 --> 04:56.490
I didn't even clean up afterwords...

04:57.280 --> 05:00.250
The person you are calling cannot be reached...

05:01.710 --> 05:05.330
Of course... he won't answer his phone...

05:11.560 --> 05:13.740
Morinaga

05:14.510 --> 05:15.550
Hello!

05:15.550 --> 05:16.760
Morinaga-san!

05:16.800 --> 05:19.010
Hello! It's been a while!

05:19.850 --> 05:22.310
Kanako-chan? It has been a while.

05:22.350 --> 05:25.230
Umm... is Senpai home...?

05:25.270 --> 05:30.070
He's home, but he said he's not feeling well and so he's been laying down the whole time...

05:30.110 --> 05:32.610
He came home by taxi! I was so surprised!

05:32.610 --> 05:37.700
I see... Umm... if it seems like he can talk, I'd like to talk to him...

05:37.740 --> 05:40.220
Yeah, I think it's okay.

05:40.220 --> 05:41.640
Hold on.

05:43.580 --> 05:46.960
Nii-san, you have a call from Morinaga-san...

05:47.250 --> 05:47.960
Hang up!

05:48.000 --> 05:50.380
Eh? What's wrong?

05:50.880 --> 05:52.260
It's fine, just hang up!

05:53.130 --> 05:54.470
...Did you hear that?

05:54.510 --> 05:55.930
Yeah...

05:56.760 --> 06:03.560
Morinaga-san says, "I'm going to leave a message telling Kanako-chan everything, is that okay?"

06:04.180 --> 06:05.440
Give it to me!

06:10.070 --> 06:11.400
What do you want?

06:12.030 --> 06:16.320
Ah... I was wondering... if you're feeling okay...?

06:18.030 --> 06:21.240
How nice, coming from the assailant.

06:21.280 --> 06:23.790
You don't need to worry about that.

06:23.790 --> 06:25.830
If that's all, then I'm gonna hang up.

06:26.040 --> 06:29.330
Ah...! Wait...! It's about school!

06:29.580 --> 06:30.300
Eh?

06:31.000 --> 06:34.880
You don't want to see me, right...?

06:35.840 --> 06:41.760
So I'm going to do your experiments for you until you can come back...

06:42.220 --> 06:43.260
You don't need to!

06:44.180 --> 06:48.100
But... are you okay with the
colony in petri dish A dying out?

06:48.740 --> 06:49.360
Ugh...

06:50.480 --> 06:52.900
It's fine, just let me do it.

06:52.940 --> 06:57.950
I won't show my face there anymore once you're able to come back.

06:57.990 --> 07:00.120
That's why I'm asking.

07:00.820 --> 07:04.120
...I'll come on Monday... I think...

07:04.330 --> 07:07.910
Monday? Okay, got it.

07:07.960 --> 07:08.500
Bye...

07:08.500 --> 07:12.380
Ah! Senpai! Wait... just one more thing...

07:14.170 --> 07:16.600
Senpai! You know I...!

07:16.900 --> 07:19.300
I've liked you a lot longer...

07:19.460 --> 07:22.000
Probably much, much longer......

07:22.200 --> 07:26.100
Than you think... I have...!!

07:26.520 --> 07:31.440
I seriously... think I could do anything for you...

07:31.480 --> 07:33.900
I had no intention of hurting you!

07:33.940 --> 07:37.240
I just want you... to know that...

07:45.620 --> 07:46.520
Why?

07:47.520 --> 07:49.000
Why wasn't I...

07:50.300 --> 07:53.460
able to... hold back at that time...?

07:55.340 --> 07:57.960
But... I guess it can't be helped...

07:58.920 --> 08:01.470
Since even now...

08:01.510 --> 08:06.720
just hearing his voice on the phone... made me want to hold him.

08:07.520 --> 08:08.360
I just love him...

08:08.840 --> 08:10.880
and love him and love him!

08:11.720 --> 08:13.200
So much that I can't stand it...

08:15.520 --> 08:18.960
Student Affairs

08:17.190 --> 08:23.320
So of course... this would be the only way this could end...

08:22.020 --> 08:26.600
N University Present

08:22.020 --> 08:26.600
Withdrawal Request

08:22.020 --> 08:26.600
This is a request to for the following record
to be withdrawn from your school at this time.

08:22.020 --> 08:26.600
Record:

08:44.560 --> 08:48.520
Monday

08:54.560 --> 08:58.540
Laboratory #2

09:03.570 --> 09:06.410
Well... of course he isn't here.

09:07.030 --> 09:09.160
I'm the one who told him I didn't want to see him.

09:12.830 --> 09:14.960
And if he did come, I'd punch him.

09:15.830 --> 09:19.050
Huh? These petri dishes are his, aren't they...?

09:19.670 --> 09:22.260
What's he going to do? Just leave them...?

09:23.090 --> 09:25.300
...Like I care. That's what he gets.

09:29.800 --> 09:33.160
Aah! Look! I told you!

09:33.160 --> 09:35.480
The culture medium has gotten all cloudy...!

09:35.730 --> 09:40.980
That asshole! There are ways for him to continue his work without seeing me, aren't there?

09:41.030 --> 09:42.360
I'm pissed off!

09:42.400 --> 09:43.620
If this is the case...

09:43.620 --> 09:46.740
I'll take this, and do this, and then do this!

09:47.030 --> 09:48.740
Okay, done!

09:49.830 --> 09:55.460
With just a drop of this, it will leave him on the brink of death for 3 days and nights!

10:01.250 --> 10:05.050
If he's not here, then I can't give it to him...

10:06.480 --> 10:09.500
Friday

10:10.920 --> 10:11.940
Senpai!

10:12.620 --> 10:15.140
Tatsumi-senpai, can I talk to you?

10:16.020 --> 10:19.860
Morinaga hasn't been to any of his lectures this week...

10:19.860 --> 10:21.480
Do you know anything about that?

10:23.150 --> 10:24.740
No... I don't...

10:25.280 --> 10:28.820
He hasn't shown up at the lab either, has he?

10:28.870 --> 10:32.990
We can't contact him either,
so everyone's worried about him.

10:34.000 --> 10:36.750
...I don't know either!

10:37.170 --> 10:41.210
Even when the guy who helps you so enthusiastically stops coming...

10:41.250 --> 10:43.000
You're not worried?

10:43.920 --> 10:46.090
You actually know something, don't you?

10:48.510 --> 10:50.220
I don't know what I don't know!

10:52.310 --> 10:56.310
And that guy...!!
I told him not to show his face to me...

10:56.350 --> 10:58.440
But I didn't tell him not to come to school!

11:00.270 --> 11:02.820
Tsk. He really turned it off.

11:02.860 --> 11:05.150
What is he thinking?

11:05.820 --> 11:06.530
Could he have...!

11:06.510 --> 11:09.510
Student Affairs

11:07.700 --> 11:09.700
He put in a leave of absence!?

11:09.740 --> 11:12.080
I guess last weekend.

11:12.120 --> 11:14.800
A lot of people do that around this time.

11:15.000 --> 11:18.420
At first, he just wanted to withdraw...

11:18.460 --> 11:22.700
He seemed really worried over something, so I tried to calm him down...

11:22.740 --> 11:26.010
and I recommended that he just put in a leave of absence first.

11:26.380 --> 11:30.840
If you're his friend, then why don't you try to talk to him about it...?

11:31.430 --> 11:32.680
That idiot!

11:32.720 --> 11:35.970
He's done this before so I thought he might, and he did!

11:38.230 --> 11:39.560
Hey, Morinaga!

11:39.600 --> 11:40.900
I want to talk to you!

11:43.770 --> 11:46.190
Morinaga! Are you not here?

11:48.820 --> 11:51.160
His mail is quite piled up...?

11:51.660 --> 11:55.540
Could this be<i> that?</i>
He's just disappearing without a trace!?

11:57.910 --> 11:59.870
He put in a leave of absence?

12:00.640 --> 12:02.420
What does that mean?

12:02.460 --> 12:04.710
He didn't say anything about that to us!

12:04.750 --> 12:06.250
I don't know either!!

12:06.300 --> 12:10.590
It's something he decided on his own, isn't it?
There's no point in complaining to other people about it!

12:10.720 --> 12:15.310
That's true. But we can't contact him at all either...

12:15.810 --> 12:19.600
Just quitting school without saying anything to anyone...

12:19.640 --> 12:23.560
Could... Morinaga-kun just be pretending to quit and...!

12:23.980 --> 12:25.690
Don't say such ominous things!

12:25.690 --> 12:26.650
But!

12:27.230 --> 12:31.130
Senpai! You're the one closest to him, aren't you, Senpai?

12:31.130 --> 12:34.140
There's no way you didn't know anything, is there?

12:34.200 --> 12:38.120
Even if I did... there are times when you can't do anything, right!?

12:39.000 --> 12:42.080
That idiot! He takes things to the extreme.

12:42.870 --> 12:46.460
Not showing your face doesn't mean to disappear completely!

12:46.500 --> 12:49.010
Since you have a lot of friends!

12:49.050 --> 12:52.430
I don't care about me, but contact them!

12:54.640 --> 12:56.430
He's not here today either...

12:58.930 --> 13:03.190
That girl probably has a little crush on you, doesn't she?

13:05.520 --> 13:10.110
You should stop being gay and try going out with her...

13:19.200 --> 13:22.500
Shit! Why does that irritate me so much?

13:25.730 --> 13:29.150
Student Affairs

13:26.330 --> 13:29.170
Morinaga-kun's parents’ contact information?

13:29.920 --> 13:33.510
Really we shouldn't give it out
without the person's permission, though.

13:33.550 --> 13:34.760
Thank you.

13:35.550 --> 13:37.550
Well, since things are they way they are.

13:38.930 --> 13:42.520
I don't know... We haven't heard anything either...

13:42.680 --> 13:43.460
Oh...

13:44.520 --> 13:50.150
Besides, that kid hasn't really
contacted us in the past few years.

13:51.030 --> 13:55.910
Ahh, that's right. He has said that he
doesn't really get along with his parents.

13:56.110 --> 13:59.240
I don't really know the details, though...

13:59.280 --> 14:00.740
I see.

14:01.040 --> 14:05.250
We've all been searching places we think he's likely to go...

14:05.290 --> 14:07.210
But we haven't found anything...

14:07.540 --> 14:11.920
Do you know of any other places he likes to go?

14:12.840 --> 14:18.180
I don't. I don't know where he goes... at all.

14:18.220 --> 14:22.640
Did I really know so little about him?

14:26.940 --> 14:31.270
Why do I come to check every day?

14:33.740 --> 14:36.150
He's obviously not going to be here today either...

14:41.030 --> 14:42.410
See...

14:44.960 --> 14:47.000
Shit! Like I care!

14:47.020 --> 14:50.170
Actually, not seeing his face is a relief for me!

14:50.460 --> 14:52.320
So it's convenient!

14:52.980 --> 14:54.600
I'm busy!!

14:57.140 --> 14:58.020
Ah!

14:58.300 --> 15:00.220
Tsk, I messed up.

15:00.260 --> 15:02.390
Hey, tweezers!

15:11.770 --> 15:14.440
I'm... an idiot.

15:25.950 --> 15:29.330
Today's no good either, huh?
How many days has it been?

15:30.130 --> 15:35.300
10, 11, 12, 13, 14...

15:36.260 --> 15:37.300
Two weeks!?

15:39.800 --> 15:44.140
Maybe we really should call the police soon...

15:44.180 --> 15:46.140
Hey... what is that?

15:46.180 --> 15:46.890
Eh?

15:46.930 --> 15:50.060
Woah...! No way? Is that a dead body?

15:52.280 --> 15:53.650
Eh...? Where?

15:53.690 --> 15:56.360
See, that! Over there!

15:56.400 --> 15:57.030
Where?

15:58.240 --> 16:00.070
Eh? That!

16:01.110 --> 16:03.870
Ehh! That's just a mannequin, isn't it?

16:03.870 --> 16:05.140
Oh, really?

16:05.140 --> 16:06.390
Look closer.

16:06.450 --> 16:08.500
There's no way it would be a dead body, you know? You idiot!

16:08.500 --> 16:11.250
Don't scare me, assholes!! Fucking cute couple!!

16:16.000 --> 16:16.920
Shit...!

16:19.920 --> 16:21.680
Damn it...!

16:23.550 --> 16:24.680
Why...?

16:27.760 --> 16:29.140
Why...?

16:29.890 --> 16:32.810
You should at least... contact someone...!

16:35.520 --> 16:37.860
I'm pissed off.

16:37.900 --> 16:41.110
Of course I would be after you did that.

16:43.700 --> 16:45.160
Welcome back!

16:45.160 --> 16:47.580
Huh? What's wrong?

16:47.620 --> 16:50.540
Nothing. Make sure to close the door.

16:50.580 --> 16:51.870
Eh...? But...

16:52.790 --> 16:56.880
But I never said to cut off relations completely!

16:58.580 --> 16:59.500
Huh?

17:02.340 --> 17:06.810
I didn't... plan on cutting off relations with him...?

17:08.600 --> 17:10.930
When I get angry, he'd apologize...

17:11.770 --> 17:14.850
then I'd slowly forgive him over time...

17:15.810 --> 17:18.610
and then he'd follow me around like a happy puppy.

17:19.480 --> 17:21.190
That pattern...

17:23.030 --> 17:29.740
Was I... really okay with this
turning out that way this time...?

17:32.330 --> 17:34.420
Am I the only one in the wrong here...?

17:36.250 --> 17:38.840
Okay, I accept that.

17:39.800 --> 17:42.420
You were so insensitive, Senpai!

17:44.220 --> 17:47.930
I might have also been...
A LITTLE  in the wrong, probably.

17:51.770 --> 17:59.940
So it's okay... to come back... now...

18:01.230 --> 18:02.240
Damn it!

18:03.160 --> 18:05.780
This is... cruel!

18:05.820 --> 18:09.030
If I can't see your face...
I can't forgive you either, can I?

18:09.870 --> 18:13.870
So just come back already, you idiot!

18:14.790 --> 18:19.250
I'd never felt a sense of loss like this ever before.

18:22.300 --> 18:25.840
Calm down! You just went there at lunch time!

18:25.880 --> 18:28.470
It's going to be the same
no matter how many times you go.

18:29.300 --> 18:32.100
I can't concentrate! Damn it!

18:33.020 --> 18:36.190
Fine...! I can get something to eat on the way.

18:37.690 --> 18:41.650
I know it's pointless! I know!

18:45.700 --> 18:46.490
The lights!?

18:50.030 --> 18:51.200
It's open!?

18:53.750 --> 18:54.580
Morinaga!

18:54.580 --> 18:55.180
Ah?

18:56.860 --> 18:59.920
Eh? Senpai... Why are you...?

19:02.340 --> 19:04.380
You... You asshole!

19:04.380 --> 19:06.820
Where have you been up until now!?

19:07.970 --> 19:11.550
Wh-what are you doing all of the sudden!?!

19:11.600 --> 19:14.560
Shut up! Where were you hiding up until now?

19:15.770 --> 19:20.770
Huh? I wasn't really hiding...
I just went back to my hometown

19:20.810 --> 19:23.270
Liar! I called your parents!

19:23.320 --> 19:26.950
Ah... I didn't contact my parents...

19:26.990 --> 19:30.240
...Wait, Senpai! How do you
know how to contact my parents?

19:30.280 --> 19:33.290
You can figure out that sort of stuff if you look!

19:33.330 --> 19:35.410
You looked? Why?

19:35.450 --> 19:37.830
Because you wouldn't contact me!?

19:37.870 --> 19:42.380
Contact you? Why would I contact you, Senpai?

19:42.420 --> 19:45.460
I was trying my best to completely disconnect from you!

19:45.510 --> 19:47.170
So there's no way I would!

19:51.140 --> 19:53.970
Besides, why are you even here, Senpai?

19:54.010 --> 19:56.730
Didn't you not want to see me?

19:56.730 --> 20:00.850
That's because you just went and put in a leave of absence!

20:00.900 --> 20:05.690
Because if I stay at the university, I'll always run into you!

20:05.730 --> 20:09.280
I don't want to make this any more painful for you than it already is...

20:09.320 --> 20:13.780
And above all...
I don't think... I can hold back anymore...

20:13.780 --> 20:16.330
So I was prepared to never see you again!

20:17.250 --> 20:19.710
I was also planning on moving out of my apartment...

20:19.750 --> 20:23.080
I just stopped by for a bit today to pack...

20:23.380 --> 20:26.050
Seriously... why are you here?

20:26.090 --> 20:28.340
You have really bad timing...

20:28.720 --> 20:30.510
You are cruel...

20:30.510 --> 20:31.180
Eh?

20:31.470 --> 20:34.510
You always jump straight to doing that...

20:34.550 --> 20:39.640
Just plotting to quit school and disappear...

20:39.680 --> 20:41.980
That's the same as blackmail, isn't it...?

20:42.020 --> 20:44.110
Eh? What was that?

20:44.150 --> 20:46.440
Blackmail! I said it's blackmail!

20:46.480 --> 20:47.570
Huh...?

20:48.440 --> 20:50.150
It is, isn't it?

20:50.200 --> 20:52.820
You did the same thing a year ago!

20:52.860 --> 20:54.990
You get so self-absorbed!

20:55.030 --> 20:57.290
Woah! Woah! Woah!

20:57.330 --> 21:00.250
And you think that by
threatening me I'll give in, don't you!?

21:00.290 --> 21:02.210
You asshole, that's not how this works!

21:02.250 --> 21:03.630
Senpai, wait!

21:03.630 --> 21:10.470
Umm... For you, is me leaving...
something that can be used to blackmail you?

21:13.720 --> 21:14.380
If...

21:17.350 --> 21:18.440
If I said yes...

21:19.040 --> 21:21.340
Is there... a problem with that?

21:22.520 --> 21:23.190
Huh?

21:23.190 --> 21:26.520
I asked, if I said yes,
is there was a problem with that!?!

21:26.610 --> 21:29.400
Eh? No, not at all!

21:29.440 --> 21:32.150
And what do you mean my timing is bad!?

21:32.150 --> 21:34.240
I've been coming here every day!

21:34.280 --> 21:36.870
Today, it's actually the second time I've been here!

21:36.870 --> 21:38.160
Are you surprised!?!

21:38.620 --> 21:40.790
So whenever you came back,
I would have found you!!

21:41.330 --> 21:45.290
Oh.... Oh really...? Hmm!

21:46.210 --> 21:48.590
Did you think this would be solved...

21:48.630 --> 21:51.130
by disappearing without telling anyone?

21:51.170 --> 21:54.380
Did you think... I would accept that...?

21:54.550 --> 22:00.180
Did you think... I wouldn't feel... anything...!?

22:01.160 --> 22:03.480
Sen... pai...

22:03.520 --> 22:07.110
Do you know... how much I worried!?

22:07.110 --> 22:09.900
No... Umm, I never thought...

22:10.360 --> 22:11.900
that you'd cry...

22:12.860 --> 22:14.240
Shut up!

22:14.280 --> 22:19.780
This is just... normal salt water that comes out when I'm stressed!!

22:19.780 --> 22:21.240
Senpai!

22:21.520 --> 22:23.680
Senpai... I'm sorry!

22:24.660 --> 22:31.340
I never thought... that you'd worry that much...

22:34.590 --> 22:35.880
Sorry...

22:44.140 --> 22:45.190
Senpai...

22:46.680 --> 22:50.150
Don't go anywhere without
saying anything anymore, okay?

22:50.190 --> 22:53.400
Senpai... I'm sorry!

22:54.240 --> 22:55.650
I'm really sorry!

22:55.700 --> 22:59.280
I'll never make you... feel that way again...

22:59.780 --> 23:00.740
Senpai!

23:10.000 --> 23:12.460
What are you doing, idiot!?!

23:12.460 --> 23:13.960
Eh? But?

23:14.010 --> 23:15.880
Don't misunderstand!!

23:16.840 --> 23:22.720
Umm... Didn't that mean that doing this is okay?

23:22.760 --> 23:24.020
No!!

23:24.930 --> 23:29.560
You're kidding me!
You don't want me to go anywhere, do you?

23:29.600 --> 23:31.730
This and that are different things!

23:36.280 --> 23:38.240
They aren't different.

23:40.990 --> 23:44.040
At least for me, they aren't different.

23:44.080 --> 23:47.460
My "like" is this kind of like.

23:48.210 --> 23:49.830
I want us to hold each other.

23:52.290 --> 23:56.170
As long as I'm near you, that will never change.

23:56.170 --> 23:58.880
So you really are Blackmailing me...?

23:58.930 --> 24:02.010
I don't get it. How am I blackmailing you?

24:05.560 --> 24:08.230
I didn't use any weird drug today, so...

24:08.230 --> 24:11.480
If you really don't want to,
go ahead and push me away.

24:12.020 --> 24:16.570
But of course, then I'll have to put in my withdrawal form.

24:16.610 --> 24:18.820
So you really are blackmailing me!!

24:19.740 --> 24:23.530
But you seem to need an excuse.

24:23.620 --> 24:24.600
Huh?

24:25.120 --> 24:28.750
It's okay, I'll be the cruel one then.

24:40.090 --> 24:42.010
Shit! Shit!

24:42.890 --> 24:45.930
He's saying that like he knows something!

24:49.770 --> 24:52.900
Umm... You don't have to...

24:53.720 --> 24:56.000
look like you hate it so much...?

24:57.110 --> 25:00.030
Are you forcing yourself that much?

25:00.950 --> 25:02.620
Of course I am!

25:03.040 --> 25:05.780
I'm at my limit here!

25:05.780 --> 25:06.600
Eh?

25:07.040 --> 25:09.080
But I'm trying so hard.

25:18.550 --> 25:22.930
But I'm glad. You're actually getting hard.

25:22.970 --> 25:26.640
Don't report on things out loud!! Can't you do it quietly?!

25:27.510 --> 25:28.810
Sorry.

25:31.520 --> 25:33.190
Why am I...

25:34.020 --> 25:35.560
Ah, wait!

25:37.610 --> 25:40.490
letting him do whatever he wants?

25:52.830 --> 25:53.870
Sexy.

25:54.710 --> 25:56.580
What are you staring at!?!

25:56.630 --> 25:59.130
No... I'm just happy!

26:07.010 --> 26:08.350
Damn it!

26:08.390 --> 26:09.510
Senpai...

26:10.520 --> 26:12.980
What am I doing?

26:16.310 --> 26:17.400
Damn it!

26:19.940 --> 26:21.320
Just remember...

26:23.530 --> 26:24.570
the reason...

26:26.530 --> 26:30.580
I can overlook that...

26:26.530 --> 26:30.580
Senpai, hold on to me. Here, see?

26:33.500 --> 26:35.250
and this and everything!

26:40.210 --> 26:43.970
The reason I can overlook it all...
is because you're special!

26:49.720 --> 26:53.730
That's the reason why.

26:54.680 --> 26:56.920
Senpai, I love you!

26:57.840 --> 26:58.920
I love you!

27:09.030 --> 27:15.250
...So, in the end, where did you go for more than two whole weeks?

27:15.370 --> 27:20.000
I told you, didn't I? I went to my hometown.

27:20.340 --> 27:21.920
In Fukuoka?

27:21.920 --> 27:29.140
After leaving here, I was planning to take the entrance exam for a graduate school in my hometown through someone I know.

27:30.260 --> 27:32.180
So I was doing various things...

27:32.180 --> 27:36.520
I can't go back to my parents place,
so I was staying with someone I know.

27:37.180 --> 27:38.240
Hmm...

27:38.880 --> 27:43.610
So... you undid all of that before coming here right...?

27:43.650 --> 27:46.320
Yes! Of course I did!

27:46.360 --> 27:48.820
I see. Then good.

27:48.980 --> 27:50.560
Ah, Senpai?

27:51.280 --> 27:54.620
Umm... There's just something I want to make sure of...

27:55.450 --> 27:59.670
We're... dating now right...?

28:00.080 --> 28:01.940
Don't say such gross things!!

28:02.020 --> 28:03.420
You make me sound gay!

28:03.460 --> 28:04.170
Huh!?

28:04.210 --> 28:07.860
Umm... I definitely think you're definitely ga-

28:07.860 --> 28:11.520
Eh?... Eh? Ehh...?

28:14.660 --> 28:15.540
Huh?

28:15.840 --> 28:20.730
So then... when's the next time... we can have sex...?

28:20.770 --> 28:24.360
Or... will there be a next time...?
